DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The rrccccttll utility can enable or disable a base system _s_e_r_v_i_c_e or a base
     system or package _d_a_e_m_o_n in rc.conf.local(8) or display its configuration
     and status.  For a _d_a_e_m_o_n, it can also change the command line arguments,
     the user to run as, the rc.d(8) action timeout or call its rc.d(8) _d_a_e_m_o_n
     control script.

     The following commands are available (_v_a_r_i_a_b_l_e can be one of ccllaassss,
     eexxeeccddiirr, ffllaaggss, llooggggeerr, rrttaabbllee, ssttaattuuss, ttiimmeeoouutt or uusseerr):

