             Run the rc.d(8) _d_a_e_m_o_n scripts with the _a_c_t_i_o_n argument, passing
             through the specified options, if any.

     ddiissaabbllee _s_e_r_v_i_c_e _._._. | _d_a_e_m_o_n _._._.
