     ggeettddeeff _s_e_r_v_i_c_e | _d_a_e_m_o_n [_v_a_r_i_a_b_l_e]
             Like ggeett but returns the default values.

     llss _l_s_a_r_g
             Display a list of services and daemons matching _l_s_a_r_g, which can
             be one of:

                   aallll      all services and daemons
                   ffaaiilleedd   enabled but stopped daemons
                   ooffff      disabled services and daemons
                   oonn       enabled services and daemons
                   rroogguuee    daemons which are disabled but currently running
                   ssttaarrtteedd  running daemons
                   ssttooppppeedd  stopped daemons

     oorrddeerr [_d_a_e_m_o_n _._._.]
             Move the specified package daemons to the beginning of
             _p_k_g___s_c_r_i_p_t_s.  They need to be already enabled.  If no _d_a_e_m_o_n is
