             The oorrddeerr command is only needed after enabling a new daemon that
             needs to run before one or more already enabled daemons.  Specify
             the new daemon preceded by all that need to run before it, but
             not the ones depending on it.

     sseett _s_e_r_v_i_c_e | _d_a_e_m_o_n _v_a_r_i_a_b_l_e [_a_r_g_u_m_e_n_t _._._.]
